  m_text: '<size=40><color=#22D3EE>GAME DESIGN, UI AND CODE</color></size>

    Muhammad
    Hamza

    CS464 - Lab 8


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>TYPEFACES</color></size>

    Heading
    font is Exo 2 by Google Fonts

    Body font is Inter by Google Fonts


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>MUSIC</color></size>

    Menu,
    arena and results themes by Tanner Helland

    CC BY 4.0 - github.com/tannerhelland/free-music


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>SOUND
    EFFECTS</color></size>

    Kenney Interface Sounds, Impact Sounds,

    Digital
    Audio and Sci-fi Sounds

    CC0 - kenney.nl


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>ICONS
    AND SHAPES</color></size>

    Drawn by code (SpriteFactory.cs)

    No AI-generated
    images were used.


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>TOOLS</color></size>

    Unity
    6

    TextMeshPro

    Unity uGUI


    <size=40><color=#22D3EE>SPECIAL THANKS</color></size>

    Instructor:
    Muhammad Raza Butt



    <size=56><b>THANK YOU FOR PLAYING</b></size>'
